{"id":"635292","name":"柠檬虾","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/635292/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾","amount":"500g"},{"name":"青瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"柠檬","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲜虾去头去虾线，放入姜片。","img":"images/635292/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将虾上锅大火蒸熟晾凉。","img":"images/635292/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洋葱洗净切细备用。","img":"images/635292/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"青瓜洗净稍微拍一下后切小块。","img":"images/635292/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"生姜洗净切片，香菜洗净切段备用。","img":"images/635292/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"柠檬用盐搓洗净后切片备用。","img":"images/635292/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小米辣和蒜头切细备用。","img":"images/635292/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蒸好的虾剥去壳。","img":"images/635292/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入柠檬，洋葱，青瓜，姜片。","img":"images/635292/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入蒜末和小米辣，再挤入少许柠檬汁。","img":"images/635292/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放上香菜。","img":"images/635292/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入适量生抽，香醋，花生油，盐，鸡精。","img":"images/635292/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"抓拌均匀后冷藏腌制入味。","img":"images/635292/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/635292/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/635292/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/635292/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/635292/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/635292/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}